.</strong><br><a href=\"https://https://www.lut.fi/en/studies/apply-lut/applying-masters-programmes/early-bird-discount-and-scholarships-masters-studies\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" title=\"https://https//www.lut.fi/en/studies/apply-lut/applying-masters-programmes/early-bird-discount-and-scholarships-masters-studies\">Discounts for master's studies</a></p>"}},"maksullisuusKuvaus":{"en":"<p>If you are required to pay tuition fees, you will receive&nbsp;<strong>an Early bird discount of EUR 5,000 for the first academic year. </strong>To qualify, you must accept your study place and pay the remaining first-year tuition fee of EUR 10,000&nbsp;<strong>within 21 days of your official admission email.</strong><br><a href=\"https://https://www.lut.fi/en/studies/apply-lut/applying-masters-programmes/early-bird-discount-and-scholarships-masters-studies\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" title=\"https://https//www.lut.fi/en/studies/apply-lut/applying-masters-programmes/early-bird-discount-and-scholarships-masters-studies\">Discounts for master's studies</a></p>"},"suunniteltuKestoKuvaus":{},"suunniteltuKestoVuodet":2,"onkoApuraha":true,"lisatiedot":[],"maksut":[{"maksullisuustyyppi":"lukuvuosimaksu","maksunMaara":15000.0}],"suunniteltuKestoKuukaudet":0,"opetustapaKuvaus":{},"opetuskieletKuvaus":{},"opetustapa":[{"koodiUri":"opetuspaikkakk_1#1","nimi":{"fi":"Lähiopetus","sv":"Närundervisning","en":"Contact teaching"}}],"opetusaikaKuvaus":{},"opetuskieli":[{"koodiUri":"oppilaitoksenopetuskieli_4#2","nimi":{"fi":"englanti","sv":"engelska","en":"English"}}],"opetusaika":[{"koodiUri":"opetusaikakk_1#1","nimi":{"fi":"Päiväopetus","sv":"Dagundervisning","en":"Day time teaching"}}]},"yhteyshenkilot":[{"nimi":{"en":"LUT University"},"titteli":{"en":"Admissions Services"},"sahkoposti":{"en":"admission@lut.fi"},"puhelinnumero":{},"wwwSivu":{"en":"https://www.lut.fi/en/studies/technology/masters-programmes-technology/masters-programme-software-engineering"}